    "noteZh": "首屏是模糊流动的深色背景，标题 shape the sound you're after 压在上面，下面一条输入框里预填了 Crisp dub-techno at 122 BPM, sparse and hypnotic.。输入框下沿是 FULL MIX / MULTI-TRACK 切换、LENGTH 滑块（0:30）和橙色 START 按钮。再往下 Experience Stable Audio 是一排带封面的曲目条：Lava Lamp Logic、Salt The Earth、Paper Radio、Blue Hour、Chrome Alley 等，点击即听。页脚一条横幅写 Use Stable Audio in Logic, Ableton, Pro Tools and more with the plugin.，配 Download now。",
